# Test artifacts. The Playwright visual suite is local-only: `tests/` is not
# committed, so its screenshot baselines are recorded on whichever machine runs
# it. A fresh clone has no suite to run and no baselines to compare against —
# the unit and accessibility tests under src/ are the ones that travel.
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
tests/

